    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feel like doctors are always so dramatic about everything. he's been sleeping most of the day so it's not like he's totally out of it, just acting a bit out of character. it's probably just dehydration or the fever making him groggy. if i give him a higher dose of acetaminophen, like 1000mg every 4-6 hours, won't that just knock the fever down and he'll be fine by morning? i'd rather avoid the ER if i can just manage it here.",
