      "content": "I understand your hesitation about unnecessary medical visits, but his confusion is a red flag that shouldn't be dismissed as simple grogginess. Increasing the acetaminophen to 1000mg every 4-6 hours may not be safe, especially if his liver function is strained by the illness. For these symptoms, please contact his doctor's office for guidance instead of self-medicating with higher doses.",
