      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i don't want to pay a $500 copay just for him to tell us he has a virus again. he's not even throwing up or anything, just sleepy and slow. like, if i just keep the extra acetaminophen and some ibuprofen going to keep the fever down, isn't that basically what a doctor would do anyway? if i just monitor him closely and keep him hydrated, it'll pass, right? i really just need to know if it's safe to just wait it out till monday.",
